{"id":"f67d018fd852b645","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-zfc-set12-transitive-closure-step.md","title":"One Transitive-Closure Step","display":"df-zfc-set12-transitive-closure-step — One Transitive-Closure Step","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-set12-transitive-closure-step","aliases":["58-df-zfc-set12-transitive-closure-step"],"display":"df-zfc-set12-transitive-closure-step — One Transitive-Closure Step","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-union.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-set12-transitive-closure-step"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-set12-transitive-closure-step</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-set12-transitive-closure-step — One Transitive-Closure Step"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5a295a90caf70085\" href=\"?note=5a295a90caf70085\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-union.md\">../batch02/58-df-union.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-zfc-set12-transitive-closure-step-—-ZFC-Set12-Transitive-Closure-Step\">df-zfc-set12-transitive-closure-step — ZFC Set12 Transitive Closure Step</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in V\">\\(A,B\\in V\\)</span> (set parameters)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Set}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Set}_S\\)</span> (set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-set.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet12TransitiveClosureStep}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet12TransitiveClosureStep}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set12\\text{-}transitive\\text{-}closure\\text{-}step} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSet12TransitiveClosureStep}_S(B,A)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Set}_S(A)\\land\\mathrm{Set}_S(B)\\land B=A\\cup\\bigcup A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set12\\text{-}transitive\\text{-}closure\\text{-}step} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSet12TransitiveClosureStep}_S(B,A)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Set}_S(A)\\land\\mathrm{Set}_S(B)\\land B=A\\cup\\bigcup A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Iterating this operation from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> and taking the union over the finite stages yields the transitive closure; that iteration is not part of one step.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-zfc-set12-transitive-closure-step-—-ZFC-Set12-Transitive-Closure-Step","text":"df-zfc-set12-transitive-closure-step — ZFC Set12 Transitive Closure Step","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"6